<figure id="A4.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Win-rates (%) of <span id="A4.T7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">AdaSearch</span> with different sampling schedules
on the IMDB dataset for positive sentiment generation, evaluated over 300 prompts. Each row corresponds to a model, and the highest win-rate per model is shown in <span id="A4.T7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. Decay schedules (Exponential, Linear, Quadratic) and Growth schedules are compared, along with the uniform baseline.</figcaption>
